          "content": "A\n\n**Explanation:** \nThis choice generates a significantly higher total and average standard of living across the population as a whole. While the vulnerability of those at the bottom is a serious concern, the fact that nearly every tier of society experiences greater material well-being means that aggregate happiness, flourishing, and overall quality of life are substantially maximized. Under conditions of uncertainty, choosing the option that produces the greatest net well-being offers the highest expected benefit for the largest number of people.",
